   625	            /// the OSC parser does not implement. Zero, the default,
   626	            /// discards these sequences. Any other value sends them to the
   627	            /// handler as `osc_unknown` actions. See
   628	            /// `osc.Parser.unknown_max_bytes` for how the limit behaves.
   629	            ///
